// base slab          → CylinderGeometry(3.15,3.15,0.37) #57585a  + top lip CylinderGeometry(3.15,3.15,0.08) #8d8e90
// focus dots F',F    → SphereGeometry(0.09) #12365c at (±2.236, 0.05, 0)
